The Din-Rail Relay CB432 is a device with wattage (W) and kilowatt hours (kWh) measurement functions. It allows you to control On/Off status and check real-time energy usage via the mobile App.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0, works with any standard ZigBee hub
- Measures instantaneous and accumulative energy consumption (W and kWh)
- Calibrated metering: ≤100W within ±2W, >100W within ±2%
- Schedule devices to automatically power on and off
- 32A or 63A load models
- Extends the range and strengthens ZigBee network communication
